src-tauri/Frameworks/

# Tauri updater signing keys — NEVER commit a private key. The real key lives
# outside the repo (~/.tauri/) and in CI secrets; this is a safety net in case
# one is ever generated here. The .pub is public (it's also embedded in
# tauri.conf.json), so only the private key is ignored.
*.key
!*.pub

# Env files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
